  "intentionalHolds": [
    "Strict pnpm remains blocked on Nuxt 4.5.1 because @nuxt/devtools 3.4.0 depends on vite-plugin-inspect ^11.3.3, vite-plugin-vue-tracer ^1.3.0, and their Vite helpers whose published peer ranges stop at Vite 7; do not relax strict peers, inject consumer dependencies, or override the graph.",
    "RC.2 targets pnpm support and cannot publish until its strict pnpm gate passes. Strict npm is observational because oxc-parser 0.140.0's optional WASM binding selects @napi-rs/wasm-runtime 1.2.0, whose @emnapi/core 2 alpha peer conflicts with oxc-parser's exact @emnapi/core 1.11.2; do not use force, legacy peer resolution, or an override.",
    "structured-clone-es@2.0.1 has an exact same-day minimum-release-age waiver through 2026-07-30T00:00:00Z; remove the pnpm-workspace.yaml entry after it is at least 24 hours old.",
